  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x15a;vetana Phase II: Scaling up of PPTCT Services in the public and private health sector across 22 states/Union Territories of India - India (01-Jan-2018-31-Mar-2021)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India, HIV, Solidarity and Action Against The HIV Infection in India (SAATHII)This program has the following goals: Achieving zero new infections, zero AIDS-related deaths and zero AIDS related stigma &amp; discrimination. The objectives of this program are: Reduce new infections by 80% by 2024.  Ensure 95% of estimated PLHIV know their status by 2024.  Ensure ART initiation and retention of 95% PLHIV for sustained viral suppression by 2024.  Eliminate mother-to-child transmission of HIV and syphilis by 2020.  Eliminate HIV/AIDS related stigma and discrimination by 2020.  Facilitate sustainable NACP service delivery by 2024</narrative>
  </description>
